    },
    {
      "id": "tang-798",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "田侍郎 其七",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王建",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "笳声万里动燕山，草白天清塞马闲。\n触处不如别处乐，可怜秋月照江关。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "7a11993e8be8d832174e9c75c3007bcdba8a62c3a4024028967766041f33b2e2",
