    },
    {
      "id": "tang-799",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "相和歌辞。拔蒲歌",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "张祜",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "拔蒲来，领郎镜湖边。\n郎心在何处，莫趁新莲去。\n拔得无心蒲，问郎看好无。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "80ff989407de6a75163591e3a3da7db81c7765c7d0a96146c0127dffd40e1cfb",
