    },
    {
      "id": "tang-800",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "奉和添酒中六咏。酒杯",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "皮日休",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "昔有嵇氏子，龙章而凤姿。\n手挥五弦罢，聊复一樽持。\n但取性淡泊，不知味醇醨.兹器不复见，家家唯玉卮。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "9e6312e5ed60758ceb5935b2cd63511ab93a95a0ec3b3d0bd8c2c7964fd4bf28",
      "estimatedOutput": 700,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-800--9e6312e5ed60758ceb5935b2cd63511ab93a95a0ec3b3d0bd8c2c7964fd4bf28.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-801",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "劝酒",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "劝君一盏君莫辞，劝君两盏君莫疑，劝君三盏君始知。\n面上今日老昨日，心中醉时胜醒时。\n天地迢遥自长久，白兔赤乌相趁走。\n身后堆金拄北斗，不如生前一樽酒。\n君不见春明门外天欲明，喧喧歌哭半死生。\n游人驻马出不得，白舆素车争路行。\n归去来，头已白，典钱将用买酒吃。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "bd9f60e4c29d7c0ff0cb56016f877793a2bfe8239b9a7b71aa11b5023ab99bd0",
      "estimatedOutput": 858,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-801--bd9f60e4c29d7c0ff0cb56016f877793a2bfe8239b9a7b71aa11b5023ab99bd0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-802",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "瞿塘两崖",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "三峡传何处，双崖壮此门。\n入天犹石色，穿水忽云根。\n猱玃须髯古，蛟龙窟宅尊。\n羲和冬驭近，愁畏日车翻。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "671e85f55807e8a08dfb25dda1cd3a8a0239437ce9c42dfdd2e0bb07e83c5904",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-802--671e85f55807e8a08dfb25dda1cd3a8a0239437ce9c42dfdd2e0bb07e83c5904.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-803",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "春末夏初闲游江郭二首",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "闲出乘轻屐，徐行蹋软沙。\n观鱼傍湓浦，看竹入杨家。\n林迸穿篱笋，藤飘落水花。\n雨埋钓舟小，风飏酒旗斜。\n嫩剥青菱角，浓煎白茗芽。\n淹留不知夕，城树欲栖鸦。\n柳影繁初合，莺声涩渐稀。\n早梅迎夏结，残絮送春飞。\n西日韶光尽，南风暑气微。\n展张新小簟，熨帖旧生衣。\n绿蚁杯香嫩，红丝脍缕肥。\n故园无此味，何必苦思归。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "86025aaae3d9d2b6faa4f9c065815155d85ab236d7cb95f17102b086f5bca1f5",
      "estimatedOutput": 910,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-803--86025aaae3d9d2b6faa4f9c065815155d85ab236d7cb95f17102b086f5bca1f5.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-804",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "歌者十二首 其九",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "司空图",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "白云深处寄生涯，岁暮生情赖此花。\n蜂蝶绕来忙绕袖，似知教折送邻家。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "a9de13ca7f45c7b597357afa0f9221bbdc1d4c7803cbbf7031be4f38e1d91afd",
      "estimatedOutput": 666,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-804--a9de13ca7f45c7b597357afa0f9221bbdc1d4c7803cbbf7031be4f38e1d91afd.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-805",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "与生公游石窟山",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "张九龄",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "探秘孰云远，忘怀复尔同。\n日寻高深意，宛是神仙中。\n跻险构灵室，诡制非人功。\n潜洞黝无底，殊庭忽似梦。\n岂如武安凿，自若茅山通。\n造物良有寄，嬉游乃惬衷。\n犹希咽玉液，从此升云空。\n咄咄共携手，泠然且驭风。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "59f9f271aa7183a69d257851e7715e7bdf61f71fc8e3ad5f84fb3815c9e21af0",
      "estimatedOutput": 806,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-805--59f9f271aa7183a69d257851e7715e7bdf61f71fc8e3ad5f84fb3815c9e21af0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-806",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "喜z6公自武陵至",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "齐己",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "已尽沧浪兴，还思相楚行。\n鬓全无旧黑，诗别有新清。\n暂憩临寒水，时来扣静荆。\n囊中有灵药，终不献公卿。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "90cbacbb9e7010cf1c5da9fc376864eb226398861abf0b03511f7931ee5ddd8a",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-806--90cbacbb9e7010cf1c5da9fc376864eb226398861abf0b03511f7931ee5ddd8a.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-807",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "夜期友生不至",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "姚合",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "忍寒停酒待君来，酒作凌澌火作灰。\n半夜出门重立望，月明先自下高台。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "0403fb4dd2a6b3e3e5fe99fc74dced7f2806ad5e9bf89342de71a189a138ea6a",
